# Examples

One folder per platform under `examples/`, built by CI on every pull request. [Platforms](platforms.md) lists
them.

## Host

[`examples/host/`](../examples/host/README.md) runs the library on any PC:

```bash
cmake -S examples/host -B build-example && cmake --build build-example && ./build-example/xmpl100_host_example
```

The host tests build it with warnings as errors and run it (CTest `xmpl100_host_example`).

